      "milestone_id": "craft_acacia_stairs",
      "description": "Uses inventory_has because crafting acacia stairs (6 acacia planks → 4 acacia stairs) places the result in the player's inventory. The player starts with 0 acacia_stairs, so having >=4 confirms successful crafting.",
